Third-party components
----------------------

TakeShot builds against vendor SDKs that are NOT included in this repository
and are NOT covered by the MIT License above. Each is distributed by its vendor
under that vendor's own terms; download them yourself and place them as
described in the matching vendor/<sdk>/README.md.

  Blackmagic DeckLink SDK   <https://www.blackmagicdesign.com/developer/>
  Blackmagic RAW SDK        <https://www.blackmagicdesign.com/developer/>
  RED R3D SDK               <https://www.red.com/developers>
  libsrt (MPL-2.0)          <https://github.com/Haivision/srt>
  AJA NTV2 SDK (MIT)        <https://github.com/aja-video/libajantv2>

Without the Blackmagic SDKs the corresponding targets build as stubs and the
application still runs against its demo source. The AJA entry is a prepared
slot; no code reads it yet.

libsrt is licensed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0 and is used for the SRT
output. Its headers are not committed here and its runtime is loaded dynamically,
so nothing in this repository or in a build made from it distributes any part of
libsrt. A release that BUNDLED the runtime would distribute it, and the MPL then
requires that the source of the covered files be made available to recipients
and that the licence travel with the binary — see vendor/SRTSDK/README.md before
shipping such a build.

Runtime frameworks installed by Blackmagic Desktop Video and Blackmagic RAW are
loaded dynamically at run time and are likewise not redistributed here.

Bundled fonts
-------------

