  <https://grotesklyyours.com>

  Copyright (c) 2020 Eugene Tantsurin. Resist Sans is a trademark of Groteskly
  Yours. Included here under a licence held by the project owner; it is NOT
  covered by the MIT License above and is not licensed onward to users of this
  repository.

  Two weights (Regular and Bold) ship as WOFF2 under
  Sources/TakeShotKit/Resources/, converted from the licensed OpenType/CFF
  originals. They are embedded into the pages the web remote serves
  (`RemotePage.fontCSS`) so a phone on a set network with no internet renders
  in the app's own face.
